# The pairs that make a greeting: "good evening", "good night", "good
# morning" and "good afternoon" are greetings
# and name no band (https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/good_evening,
# https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/good_night,
# https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/good_morning,
